  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRK RRM 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRK RRM 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRM mechanism has proven to be a fast and efficient resource for SRC  to provide an early response to sudden disasters. SRC plans to        channel in 2013 emergency humanitarian assistance through the         International Red Cross Federation (IFRC) to sudden humanitarian      crises.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RRM mekanismen har visat sig vara en snabb och effektiv resurs f&#xf6;r    att SRK ska kunna ge en tidig respons vid pl&#xf6;tsliga katastrofer. SRK  planerar  under 2013 kanalisera akut humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d via              Internationella R&#xf6;da Korsfederationen (IFRC) till pl&#xf6;tsligt uppkomna  humanit&#xe4;ra katastrofer.</narrative>
  </description>
